%F A036404 G.f.: -x*(1+x)*(x^2-x+1)^2 / ( (x^4+x^3+x^2+x+1)*(x-1)^3 ). - _R. J. Mathar_, Jan 22 2011
%F A036404 Sum_{n>=1} 1/a(n) = Pi^2/30 + (4*Pi*sinh(2*Pi/5))/(2*phi + 4*cosh(2*Pi/5)) - (Pi*sinh(4*Pi/5))/(phi-1 - 2*cosh(4*Pi/5)), where phi is the golden ratio (A001622). - _Amiram Eldar_, Sep 12 2026
%t A036404 a[n_] := Ceiling[n^2/5]; Array[a, 55, 0] (* _Amiram Eldar_, Sep 12 2026 *)
